{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_090_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_090_1000_p", "source_sha256": "9d97ff0cf66ed4e3d1e24bee056ad0174a8908835de92e3e443799981de585a8", "ja": "（今日はみんなと、スケジュールの調整をする予定だ。\n……ん？　このプレッシャーは……）", "zh": "（今天要和大家协调一下日程。\n……嗯？这股压力是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_090_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_090_1001_se", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_090_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_090_1002_p", "source_sha256": "2698626110558fd437652a598ac71a212a0ee83bbb93946ba52fb23523d1309f", "ja": "……やっぱり。\n朋花、みんな、お疲れさま。何の話をしてたんだ？", "zh": "……果然是这样。\n朋花，大家，辛苦了。你们在聊什么呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_090_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_090_1003_003mik", "source_sha256": "82010a1cdf25315714db7fb223bd800c25326990bb3c9ebd68c9ad9782ca9175", "ja": "ちょうどよかったの！　{$P$}が\nどうしたらデートしてくれるか、相談してたんだよ☆", "zh": "正好！我们正在商量要怎么做，{$P$}才会陪我们约会呢☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_090_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_090_1004_017kth", "source_sha256": "c06649b21d6f9e9e5ded499e3c5cd5ff4905e4cd6937aeefa8b37e4d565934f2", "ja": "美希ちゃん！？　ええっと、違うんです！\n最近、お仕事が増えたなって話をしてて……。", "zh": "美希！？那个，才不是这样！\n我们只是在说，最近工作变多了……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_090_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_090_1005_031tom", "source_sha256": "45db1b5911b64113e685373fb80397c7d799d4e76149ad0cad7da54358cbb51b", "ja": "スケジュール調整をする、という話でしたが……。\nまさかそれも、美希ちゃんとデートするためですか～？", "zh": "刚才不是说要调整日程吗……难道这也是为了和美希酱约会吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_090_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_090_1006_p", "source_sha256": "1569e63d258ebaeaac2e714ac9fdf026feb3e25781a55ccaf32037e2c5045d4b", "ja": "うっ、ますますプレッシャーが……！　違うって！\n単純に、最近予定が詰まりすぎてるからだよ。", "zh": "呜，压力越来越大了……！不是那样的啦！\n纯粹是因为最近日程排得太满了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_090_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_090_1007_003mik", "source_sha256": "c83aa2b12ff8345adda208875582e38d3fd745eb0c691b89f93e89e767562482", "ja": "むー。{$P$}、ミキのこと\nもうどうでもよくなっちゃったの？", "zh": "唔——{$P$}，你已经\n不在乎美希了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_090_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_090_1008_p", "source_sha256": "91545e2ca94188eef1a0c8ae6eea1dee8e829091536b2e80f624fe8ed945f542", "ja": "そんなわけ……というか、美希も今すごく忙しいだろ？\n新ブランドのモデル、楽しみって言ってたじゃないか。", "zh": "怎么会……话说回来，美希你现在也很忙吧？\n你不是还说很期待担任新品牌的模特吗。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_090_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_090_1009_003mik", "source_sha256": "99be9a14d12e37490d75975eb9193dd62a3e4f54aa26bbb32554ac5cbb8dcab8", "ja": "あ、そうそう！　カワイイ服とかいっぱいだから、\nすっごく楽しみなの。あはっ☆", "zh": "啊，对了对了！因为有好多可爱的衣服，\n我特别期待的。啊哈☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_090_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_090_1010_031tom", "source_sha256": "8f7e07f9da352eb105e9145f2cf642f135509dc2427106e275af9f26ae4c8979", "ja": "琴葉さんも、舞台のお仕事があると聞きましたよ～。\nレッスン、どうですか～？", "zh": "听说琴叶也有舞台工作哦～  \n排练进行得怎么样啦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_090_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_090_1011_017kth", "source_sha256": "1e6964092216c77b026d2879419745712aeb93495c46aad98a12686c6837f899", "ja": "うん、順調だよ。演出家さんがすごく上手で、\n私も勉強させてもらってるんだ。", "zh": "嗯，挺顺利的。导演非常厉害，\n我也学到了很多东西呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_090_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_090_1012_031tom", "source_sha256": "49158685476a2748b7219ef481e616b895ca646ac81a797efffc940d4628bab9", "ja": "ふふっ、楽しみですね～。……そういえば、私の公演も\nそろそろでしたよね、{$P$}さん～？", "zh": "呵呵，真让人期待呢～……说起来，我的演出也快到了吧，{$P$}先生～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_090_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_090_1013_p", "source_sha256": "50c2c79ed5cd00d88a9d52f624d7226caca518b7330038d191a87e42b7060bc0", "ja": "ああ、準備は一応予定通りに進んでるよ。\n音源も届いてるから、後で渡しておこう。", "zh": "啊，准备工作基本按计划进行着。音源也已经到了，待会儿交给你吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_090_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_090_1014_p", "source_sha256": "f55dc2c1b8cb12aa9fc33dc3a8dd46729259ecef72d09ea8a8c9fe7ea89fe389", "ja": "けど、レッスンの時間が……うーん、本当に仕事を\n詰め過ぎたな。よし、さっそく調整をしようか。", "zh": "不过，练习的时间……嗯——确实给她安排太多工作了。好，那就马上调整一下吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_090_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_090_1015_031tom", "source_sha256": "d0c0c20276f7884fb5721719cb0bf7a9865af2d30115ea2c8e9fe1486c293224", "ja": "{$P$}さん。私のお仕事でしたら、\n減らす必要はありませんからね～？", "zh": "{$P$}先生。如果是我的工作，\n可没有必要特意减少哦～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_090_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_090_1016_p", "source_sha256": "4fb0e4baa75592fba662ab3f5fcd85762f7c5fa24de9083a818590e4ce58725d", "ja": "えっ？　でも、朋花だってイベントが控えてるし……。\n今のままだとキツいだろう？", "zh": "咦？可是朋花也有活动在等着她……照现在这样下去会很辛苦吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_090_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_090_1017_031tom", "source_sha256": "aa1077f61b705958e57cb72dfa197452b9fa7410d0952c05d291f210ebc0986c", "ja": "公演もイベントも、どちらも聖母の慈愛を届ける\n大切な機会ですからね～。", "zh": "因为演出和活动，都是传达圣母慈爱的宝贵机会呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_090_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_090_1018_031tom", "source_sha256": "485a1269186de2b637d4e2936261649475714986eb2b6deb1c4c5afaa3183579", "ja": "子豚ちゃんたちをガッカリさせるわけにはいきません。\n遠慮も配慮も無用です～。", "zh": "可不能让小猪崽们失望呢。\n不需要任何顾虑，也不必客气哦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_090_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_090_1019_017kth", "source_sha256": "a3d6260735a0efded3a8f20d87cb11ecfab2790a0f9185562a91ff48a783c5b7", "ja": "朋花ちゃん……。あの、{$P$}。\n私も大丈夫です、今のままで頑張れます！", "zh": "朋花……那个，{$P$}。\n我也没问题，就这样继续努力下去！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_090_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_090_1020_017kth", "source_sha256": "b1a428c419b71e53efecfbffe35d5c6909a840f5144fd24769a3a96aac4e5ebe", "ja": "あ、でも{$P$}は平気ですか？\n私たちより、裏方の方が大変なんじゃ……？", "zh": "啊，不过{$P$}没事吗？\n比起我们，幕后人员不是更辛苦吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_090_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_090_1021_p", "source_sha256": "78c6dd83d7d0ec09d7d6781e26958fccbb93e115c4aa97352bc1be5edb5ce4b6", "ja": "こっちは平気だよ。でもみんな、本当に大丈夫か？\nかなりタイトなスケジュールになるけど……。", "zh": "我这边没问题。不过大家真的没事吗？\n日程会排得很紧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_090_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_090_1022_003mik", "source_sha256": "8c6b59ec55b5256fda53dd39c60676de60ce874f14b865fd1104eaffffc32142", "ja": "ミキは、楽しいコトなら頑張れるから大丈夫だよ？\nモデルも朋花の公演も、どっちも楽しいの！", "zh": "美希只要是开心的事情就能努力，所以没问题哦？模特工作和朋花的公演，都很开心！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_090_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_090_1023_031tom", "source_sha256": "256912ae2179f1d4d8d19b4e3f063a59df1d6c6041d702a1238cfd705c88a07f", "ja": "うふふ、ありがとうございます～。\nぜひ、美希ちゃんの力を貸してくださいね～。", "zh": "呵呵，谢谢你～。\n一定要借给我美希的力量哦～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_090_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_090_1024_031tom", "source_sha256": "a66cc82eb7f27c447de3c216cca49daf7bb8f9c3b4d14e6e0216e72e029c5019", "ja": "琴葉さんも……、{$P$}さんも。\n子豚ちゃんたちのために、よろしくお願いします～。", "zh": "琴叶也……，{$P$}先生也一样。为了小猪们，拜托你们了～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_090_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_090_1025_p", "source_sha256": "5486daba286f1de01b2c88f98eb1378e406e1e714d851e8aa0e891bcd6cf532c", "ja": "そうだな、すべては子豚ちゃんたちのため……。\nよし、それなら一旦現状維持で、やってみようか！", "zh": "是啊，一切都是为了小猪猪们……。\n好，那就先维持现状，试试看吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_090_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_090_1026_p", "source_sha256": "164a22685e3f8136e8ea66536907cad56e46ba6b49ade4519337ec9b5cfe64e1", "ja": "（ちょっと大変そうだけど、水を差すべきじゃない。\nこっちも気合いを入れていかないとな！）", "zh": "（虽然看起来有点辛苦，但不该在这时候泼冷水。我们这边也得打起精神来才行！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
